{"title":"<span style='font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;'>Lhouyangdar Khulpu</span>\n<span style='font-size: 0.88rem; color: #556c7d; line-height: 1.5; display: block; font-weight: 500;'>Early career forest ecologist | MSc Forest and Nature Conservation | BSc Forestry (Gold medalist) | National Overseas Scholarship (NOS) awardee</span>","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"<span style='font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;'>Lhouyangdar Khulpu</span>\n<span style='font-size: 0.88rem; color: #556c7d; line-height: 1.5; display: block; font-weight: 500;'>Early career forest ecologist | MSc Forest and Nature Conservation | BSc Forestry (Gold medalist) | National Overseas Scholarship (NOS) awardee</span>\n","image":"khulpu.jpg","toc":false,"about":{"template":"trestles","image-width":"14rem","links":[{"icon":"linkedin","text":"LinkedIn","href":"https://linkedin.com"},{"icon":"envelope","text":"Email","href":"mailto:lhouyangdarkhulpu@gmail.com"}]}},"headingText":"Education","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<!-- Outer wrapper adds column whitespace cushion and sets smaller global body text size -->\n<div style=\"padding-left: 3rem; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #2c3e50;\">\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n**M.Sc. Forest and Nature Conservation** <span style=\"float: right; color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;\">*2022 – 2024*</span>  \n*Wageningen University & Research, Netherlands*\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n**B.S. in Forestry (Gold Medalist)** <span style=\"float: right; color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;\">*2016 – 2020*</span>  \n*North Eastern Regional Institute of Science and Technology, Arunachal Pradesh*\n</div>\n\n<hr style=\"margin: 0.8rem 0;\">\n\n## Core Skills & Tools\n\n• **(Ecological) Data analysis** in R Programming language  \n• **Research grant** proposal writing  \n• **Scientific writing**  \n• **Remote sensing** and GIS  \n• **Tools:** R, Excel, Microsoft 365, ArcGIS, QGIS, Inkscape, Canva\n\n<hr style=\"margin: 0.8rem 0;\">\n\n## Publications\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 18px; padding-left: 1.5rem; text-indent: -1.5rem;\">\nKhulpu, L., Matsuo, T., Kok, J., Amissah, L., Abdul, S. M., Kuzee, T., & Poorter, L. (2025). Breaking down to build up: litter decomposition drives soil organic carbon accumulation in young secondary forests. *Journal of Tropical Ecology*.  \n**DOI:** [10.1017/S0266467425100321](https://doi.org)\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 18px; padding-left: 1.5rem; text-indent: -1.5rem;\">\nMatsuo, T., Amissah, L., Van Der Sande, M.T., Der Plas, F.V., Kok, J., Abdul, S.M., Chojnacki, L., Kuzee, T., **Khulpu, L.** and Poorter, L., 2026. Drivers and Mechanisms of Ecosystem Multifunctionality in Secondary Tropical Forests: T. Matsuo and others. *Ecosystems*, 29(2), p.28.  \n**DOI:** [10.1007/s10021-026-01047-1](https://doi.org)\n</div>\n\n</div>\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<!-- Outer wrapper adds column whitespace cushion and sets smaller global body text size -->\n<div style=\"padding-left: 3rem; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #2c3e50;\">\n\n## Education\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n**M.Sc. Forest and Nature Conservation** <span style=\"float: right; color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;\">*2022 – 2024*</span>  \n*Wageningen University & Research, Netherlands*\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n**B.S. in Forestry (Gold Medalist)** <span style=\"float: right; color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;\">*2016 – 2020*</span>  \n*North Eastern Regional Institute of Science and Technology, Arunachal Pradesh*\n</div>\n\n<hr style=\"margin: 0.8rem 0;\">\n\n## Core Skills & Tools\n\n• **(Ecological) Data analysis** in R Programming language  \n• **Research grant** proposal writing  \n• **Scientific writing**  \n• **Remote sensing** and GIS  \n• **Tools:** R, Excel, Microsoft 365, ArcGIS, QGIS, Inkscape, Canva\n\n<hr style=\"margin: 0.8rem 0;\">\n\n## Publications\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 18px; padding-left: 1.5rem; text-indent: -1.5rem;\">\nKhulpu, L., Matsuo, T., Kok, J., Amissah, L., Abdul, S. M., Kuzee, T., & Poorter, L. (2025). Breaking down to build up: litter decomposition drives soil organic carbon accumulation in young secondary forests. *Journal of Tropical Ecology*.  \n**DOI:** [10.1017/S0266467425100321](https://doi.org)\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 18px; padding-left: 1.5rem; text-indent: -1.5rem;\">\nMatsuo, T., Amissah, L., Van Der Sande, M.T., Der Plas, F.V., Kok, J., Abdul, S.M., Chojnacki, L., Kuzee, T., **Khulpu, L.** and Poorter, L., 2026. Drivers and Mechanisms of Ecosystem Multifunctionality in Secondary Tropical Forests: T. Matsuo and others. *Ecosystems*, 29(2), p.28.  \n**DOI:** [10.1007/s10021-026-01047-1](https://doi.org)\n</div>\n\n</div>\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":fals